{"id": "EUVD-2026-96924", "enisaUuid": "fc3b2aa1-93d8-3901-bce8-3a4f38f7266b", "description": "mistral.rs 0.9.0 through 0.9.4 contains a link following vulnerability in mistralrs-code-exec that allows sandboxed shell code to read and overwrite files outside the sandbox via symlinks. Attackers or prompt-injected agents can name symlinks as outputs or reuse sessions with symlinked input paths to access files with the server process's permissions.", "datePublished": "2026-10-11T12:19:56", "dateUpdated": "2026-10-18T11:53:05", "baseScore": 7.6, "baseScoreVersion": "4.0", "baseScoreVector": "CVSS:4.0/AV:N/AC:L/AT:P/PR:L/UI:N/VC:H/VI:H/VA:N/SC:N/SI:N/SA:N", "references": ["https://hackmd.io/@haind03/ericlbuehler-mistralrs-code-exec-output-symlink-sandbox-escape", "https://github.com/EricLBuehler/mistral.rs/blob/4400935451da5e2dc7379a3f92fbbada66557f6c/mistralrs-code-exec/src/files.rs#L241-L254", "https://github.com/EricLBuehler/mistral.rs/blob/4400935451da5e2dc7379a3f92fbbada66557f6c/mistralrs-code-exec/src/mount.rs#L30-L50", "https://github.com/EricLBuehler/mistral.rs", "https://www.vulncheck.com/advisories/mistral-rs-0.9.0-through-0.9.4-sandbox-escape-via-symlink-following-in-mistralrs-code-exec"], "aliases": ["GHSA-fjjm-5mgr-r8vp", "CVE-2026-108759"], "assigner": "VulnCheck", "epss": 0.32, "enisaIdProduct": [{"id": "f9b8c460-7900-383d-8ded-d5c6b94adf01", "product": {"name": "Mistral.rs", "vendor": {"name": "EricLBuehler"}}, "product_version": "0.9.0 \u22640.9.4"}], "enisaIdVendor": [{"id": "9f7d32d8-5af3-3b0a-818d-6dbbe7ba7799", "vendor": {"name": "EricLBuehler"}}], "isExploited": false}